OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist 'quad squad' called in 
OL,4,Ato deliver shocked couple's four babies
OL,6,FA specialist "quad squad" of 30        
OL,7,Fclinicians helped deliver a shocked    
OL,8,Fcouple's four babies.                  
OL,10,FWhen doctors told Glenna Alphonse and  
OL,11,FJohn Poul Josh they were expecting     
OL,12,Fquadruplets, the gobsmacked couple     
OL,13,Fdidn't believe them and insisted the   
OL,14,Fscan was wrong.                        
OL,16,FBut it wasn't, and in what was likened 
OL,17,Fto "a military operation" they became  
OL,18,Fone of only a handful of couples on    
OL,19,Faverage to have four babies in the UK  
OL,20,Feach year.                             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
