OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist 'quad squad' called in 
OL,4,Ato deliver shocked couple's four babies
OL,6,FFollowing the one in 700,000 pregnancy,
OL,7,Fthe two boys and two girls arrived     
OL,8,Fearlier this month and are continuing  
OL,9,Fto receive specialist neonatal care to 
OL,10,Fhelp them feed and grow.               
